    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713710/extras/0fee73374440eb635faa8f3f81461709.avif?t=1749593155\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torenstad</strong> is a small tower-builder game where the main goal is to stack your way up the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control falling blocks and try to find the best spot to place them. The score you receive is based on the number of levels you complete, their composition and type. Plan ahead, and reap your score multipliers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards and Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite build height</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance to beat your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scoring based on floors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future plans:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced block visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New scoring calculations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New types of blocks with special multipliers (roguelite style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events as the tower goes higher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >General polishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More gamemodes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank you for your support from the bottom of my heart! Much\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torenstad</strong> started as a small demo to showcase my skills, but it quickly evolved into a larger learning experience and personal challenge. My goal is to create a polished, enjoyable game that anyone can pick up and have fun with\u2014while putting into practice everything I\u2019ve learned during my Game Development Bachelor's degree. This project is close to my heart, and I truly appreciate everyone\u2019s support. If you\u2019d like to chat about the game (the bad and the good), don\u2019t hesitate to reach out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713710/extras/0fee73374440eb635faa8f3f81461709.avif?t=1749593155\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torenstad</strong> is a small tower-builder game where the main goal is to stack your way up the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control falling blocks and try to find the best spot to place them. The score you receive is based on the number of levels you complete, their composition and type. Plan ahead, and reap your score multipliers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards and Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite build height</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance to beat your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scoring based on floors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future plans:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced block visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New scoring calculations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New types of blocks with special multipliers (roguelite style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events as the tower goes higher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >General polishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More gamemodes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank you for your support from the bottom of my heart! Much\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torenstad</strong> started as a small demo to showcase my skills, but it quickly evolved into a larger learning experience and personal challenge. My goal is to create a polished, enjoyable game that anyone can pick up and have fun with\u2014while putting into practice everything I\u2019ve learned during my Game Development Bachelor's degree. This project is close to my heart, and I truly appreciate everyone\u2019s support. If you\u2019d like to chat about the game (the bad and the good), don\u2019t hesitate to reach out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
